{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlePushRegistration:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSData","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSData"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"deviceToken"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"deviceToken","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The device token Data received from APNs","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method from your AppDelegate’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application:didRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithDeviceToken:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to forward the device token to Pushwoosh.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK normally handles this automatically via method swizzling, but you may need to call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"this directly if:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You’ve disabled swizzling","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You’re managing multiple push providers","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You need custom token processing","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Manual token handling with multiple push providers:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func application(_ application: UIApplication,","                    didRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithDeviceToken deviceToken: Data) {","","        \/\/ Convert token to string for logging","        let tokenString = deviceToken.map { String(format: \"%02.2hhx\", $0) }.joined()","        Logger.info(\"Received APNs token: \\(tokenString.prefix(20))...\")","","        \/\/ Send to Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.handlePushRegistration(deviceToken)","","        \/\/ Send to other push providers if needed","        FirebaseMessaging.messaging().apnsToken = deviceToken","","        \/\/ Sync with backend","        BackendAPI.shared.updatePushToken(tokenString)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Only use this method if you need manual control.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handlePushRegistration:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Manually handles the device push token registration."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handlepushregistration:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlePushRegistration:"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)handlePushRegistration:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"handlePushRegistration:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","title":"handlePushRegistration:"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"abstract":[{"text":"Protocol defining SDK configuration methods.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"